      "source": "An implementation of this interface can also be passed into any\n<code>Callback</code>-based method such as <a href=\"AsyncTaskExecutor.html#submit(java.util.concurrent.Callable)\"><code>AsyncTaskExecutor.submit(Callable)</code></a>\nor <a href=\"AsyncTaskExecutor.html#submitCompletable(java.util.concurrent.Callable)\"><code>AsyncTaskExecutor.submitCompletable(Callable)</code></a>. It is just capable\nof adapting to flexible exception propagation in caller signatures as well.",
      "translation": "该接口的实现也可以传递给任何基于`Callback`的方法，例如<a href=\"AsyncTaskExecutor.html#submit(java.util.concurrent.Callable)\"><code>AsyncTaskExecutor.submit(Callable)</code></a>或<a href=\"AsyncTaskExecutor.html#submitCompletable(java.util.concurrent.Callable)\"><code>AsyncTaskExecutor.submitCompletable(Callable)</code></a>。它同样能够灵活地适应调用者签名中的异常传播。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
